# Preinstall the GeForce NOW (geforcenow) main-menu section on boot so a fresh
# flash already shows it WITHOUT the user having to run "Install GeForce NOW".
# Runs before EmulationStation (common autostart). Respects an explicit
# "Uninstall GeForce NOW" (marker file) and is a no-op once the launcher exists.
/usr/bin/gfn-electron-setup boot
